cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalogue, please cite it as below."
title: "Julia findings: a catalogue of differential, concolic and fuzz testing findings"
abstract: >-
  Minimized, reproducible findings from differential, concolic and fuzz testing
  of the Julia language and its standard libraries, kept in one searchable
  catalogue with standalone reproducers.
  Disclosure: julia (JuliaLang/julia), contributor; LinearAlgebra.jl, reporter
  and contributor; SparseArrays.jl, reporter; Statistics.jl, reporter;
  Concolic.jl, author; no funding, employment or other interest in a system
  examined; works with an AI assistant.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Celles
    given-names: Sébastien
    alias: s-celles
date-released: 2026-11-13
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-celles/julia-findings"
url: "https://s-celles.github.io/julia-findings/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Julia
  - differential testing
  - fuzzing
  - concolic testing
  - software correctness
